# Cirrus Vision SF50 - MFD checklist set (Perspective Touch+ Checklist page).
#
# Auto-selected when the loaded aircraft is a Cirrus Vision Jet (acf_ICAO "SF50"
# or an acf_relative_path matching the Vision Jet). The SF50 is a single-engine
# (Williams FJ33-5A) FADEC turbofan with a two-tank fuel system and CAPS, so its
# procedures differ substantially from the piston Cessna set. Values follow the
# SF50 POH normal and emergency procedures; an aircraft may override these with
# its own g1000_checklist.txt beside the .acf.

GROUP NORMAL PROCEDURES

  CHECKLIST BEFORE ENGINE START
    Preflight Inspection : COMPLETE
    Passenger Briefing : COMPLETE
    Seats, Seatbelts : ADJUST AND LOCK
    Parking Brake : SET
    BAT 1, BAT 2 : ON
    Voltage (ESS BUS) : 24V MIN
    Flaps : UP
    Fuel Quantity : CHECK
    Lights (BCN) : ON

  CHECKLIST ENGINE START
    Throttle : IDLE
    Brakes : HOLD
    Power Lever : CONFIRM IDLE
    ENG START Button : PUSH
    ITT : MONITOR (740 C MAX)
    N2 / Oil Pressure : RISING
    Starter (FADEC) : AUTO CUTOUT
    GEN 1, GEN 2 : ON / CHECK
    Avionics : CHECK

  CHECKLIST BEFORE TAXI
    Flight Instruments : CHECK AND SET
    Altimeter : SET
    Autopilot : TEST
    Flight Controls : FREE AND CORRECT
    Trims (Pitch, Roll) : SET FOR TAKEOFF
    Anti-Ice : AS REQUIRED

  CHECKLIST BEFORE TAKEOFF
    Parking Brake : SET
    Flaps : 50%
    Trims : SET FOR TAKEOFF
    Flight Controls : FREE AND CORRECT
    Throttle Response : CHECK
    CAS Messages : REVIEW
    Pitot Heat : ON
    Transponder : ALT
    Takeoff Briefing : COMPLETE

  CHECKLIST TAKEOFF
    Brakes : RELEASE
    Power : TAKEOFF THRUST
    Rotate : 90 KIAS
    Landing Gear : UP (POSITIVE RATE)
    Flaps : UP (ABOVE 110 KIAS)
    Climb Power : SET

  CHECKLIST CLIMB
    Power : CLIMB THRUST
    Airspeed : 150 KIAS / CLIMB SCHEDULE
    Pressurization : CHECK
    Anti-Ice : AS REQUIRED

  CHECKLIST CRUISE
    Power : CRUISE THRUST
    Altimeter : SET
    Fuel Balance : MONITOR
    Pressurization : CHECK

  CHECKLIST DESCENT
    Pressurization (Dest Elev) : SET
    Altimeter : SET
    Anti-Ice : AS REQUIRED
    Approach Briefing : COMPLETE

  CHECKLIST BEFORE LANDING
    Seatbelts : SECURE
    Landing Gear : DOWN (BELOW 210 KIAS)
    Flaps : 100% (BELOW 150 KIAS)
    Autopilot : DISENGAGE
    Landing Lights : ON
    Speed : VREF

  CHECKLIST AFTER LANDING
    Flaps : UP
    Pitot Heat : OFF
    Transponder : STBY
    Landing Lights : AS REQUIRED

  CHECKLIST SHUTDOWN
    Parking Brake : SET
    Throttle : IDLE
    Avionics : OFF
    Power Lever : SHUTOFF
    GEN 1, GEN 2 : OFF
    BAT 1, BAT 2 : OFF

GROUP EMERGENCY PROCEDURES

  CHECKLIST CAPS DEPLOYMENT
    Airspeed : MINIMUM POSSIBLE (135 KIAS MAX)
    CAPS Activation Handle : PULL (BOTH HANDS)
    Mixture / Power Lever : SHUTOFF (AFTER IMPACT)
    BAT 1, BAT 2 : OFF (AFTER IMPACT)
    Occupants : BRACE FOR IMPACT

  CHECKLIST ENGINE FAILURE IN FLIGHT
    Airspeed : 110 KIAS (GLIDE)
    CAPS : CONSIDER
    Power Lever : IDLE THEN SHUTOFF
    ENG START : ATTEMPT RESTART (IF TIME)
    Landing Site : SELECT
    Emergency : DECLARE

  CHECKLIST EMERGENCY DESCENT
    Power Lever : IDLE
    Speed Brakes : N/A
    Airspeed : 250 KIAS MAX (GEAR UP)
    Landing Gear : DOWN (BELOW 210 KIAS)
    Autopilot : AS REQUIRED

  CHECKLIST CABIN DEPRESSURIZATION
    Oxygen Masks : DON / 100%
    Crew Communication : ESTABLISH
    Emergency Descent : INITIATE
    Altitude : 13000 FT OR MEA
